<title>POLAND: FORECAST-Polish zloty seen at 3.3907 vs dlr end-97.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Polish zloty seen at 3.3907 vs dlr end-97.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish zloty is seen easing against the dollar by the end of the year and the prediction is more pessimistic than last month, according to a Reuter poll of the country's 23 largest banks.</p>
<p>On Monday the zloty was fixed at 3.2180 to the dollar.</p>
<p>		    JUNE	  END-97	   12-MONTHS AHEAD</p>
<p> USD/PLN AVG   3.2411    3.3907 (3.3672)   3.5385 (3.4718)</p>
<p>     MINIMUM   3.2250    3.2700 (3.1900)   3.3000 (3.2100)</p>
<p>     MAXIMUM   3.2649    3.5200 (3.5200)   3.7500 (3.7500)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets previous figures for end-97 and May-98 from last month's poll. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
